Currently, the `schema.txt` template is hardcoded to:
```txt
index: {{ field.index }}
```

which means we are unable to define fields like eg. this:

```txt
field predicate_field type predicate {
            indexing: attribute
            index {
                arity: 2  # mandatory
                lower-bound: 3
                upper-bound: 200
                dense-posting-list-threshold: 0.25
            }
        }
```
